WEBVTT

00:10:32.151 --> 00:10:35.151
(Aplauz)

00:10:41.228 --> 00:10:45.280
Martin Bustamante:
"Srce žvaće suze vremena

00:10:45.464 --> 00:10:47.836
zaslepljeno tom svetlošću

00:10:48.331 --> 00:10:51.706
prikriva brzinu postojanja

00:10:51.741 --> 00:10:53.414
kad slike naviru kao vesla,

00:10:53.414 --> 00:10:55.971
bori se, ne posustaje.

00:10:56.822 --> 00:11:00.004
Srce se slama pod tužnim pogledima